尘埃拉力赛2.0的Dashboard仪表盘项目  
Dashboard project for DiRT Rally 2.0  
  
基于ESP32 3.5英寸液晶屏开发板 CYD-ESP32-3248S035R  
Based on an ESP32 3.5-inch LCD development board CYD-ESP32-3248S035R  
  
接收游戏UDP数据包并显示到仪表盘  
Receives UDP data packets from the game and displays them on the dashboard  
  
显示档位、转速、四轮刹车片温度、四轮悬挂实时行程、计时、赛段完成百分比等信息  
Displays information such as gear, engine speed, brake temperatures for all four wheels, real-time suspension travel for all four wheels, timing, and Stage Progress (%)  
  